{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33173","headline":"筑台 · 司马扎","name":"筑台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魏国昔强盛，宫中金玉多。\n徵丁筑层台，唯恐不巍峩。\n结构切星汉，跻攀横绮罗。\n朝观细腰舞，夜听皓齿歌。\n讵念人力劳，安问黍与禾。\n一朝国既倾，千仞堂亦平。\n舞模衰柳影，歌留草虫声。\n月照白露寒，苍苍故邺城。\n汉文有遗美，对此清飙生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}